WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
Locate the demonstration field using latitude and longitude.

00:10.000 --> 00:26.000
Draw the field boundary manually on the aerial image.

00:26.000 --> 00:43.000
Create and name the parcels inside the field.

00:43.000 --> 00:58.000
Assign crops to parcels for the selected growing season.

00:58.000 --> 01:08.000
Add local knowledge: irrigation, drainage and known or unknown soil depth.

01:08.000 --> 01:20.000
Explore a second season and change a crop in the rotation.

01:20.000 --> 01:36.000
Explore hypothetical dry and wet scenarios. These are assumptions, not forecasts.

01:36.000 --> 01:46.000
The prepared assistant explanation connects drainage information with the wet scenario and notes missing soil depth.

01:46.000 --> 01:50.000
Return to the field overview. This is an animated interface prototype.
